        <mxCell id="comet" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Spark + Comet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DataFusion • Rust • Arrow&lt;br&gt;native operators hoặc JVM fallback" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d1fae5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
